    new "六、结论"

    # game/codex.rpy:1195
    old "The Federation Inquisition is neither an army nor a law enforcement agency."
    new "联邦审判庭既不是军队，也不是执法机构。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1196
    old "It is an instrument of final resolution, intended for situations in which other mechanisms lose effectiveness."
    new "它是最终解决工具，用于其他机制失效的情况。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1198
    old "The existence of the Inquisition guarantees the stability of the Federation."
    new "审判庭的存在保障了联邦的稳定。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1199
    old "At the same time, its presence serves as a reminder:"
    new "同时，它的存在也是一种提醒："

    # game/codex.rpy:1200
    old "the limits of permissibility are defined not by law, but by the necessity of system survival."
    new "可容许的界限不是由法律定义的，而是由系统生存的必要性决定的。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1210
    old "Classified Archive. Clearance Level: III–VI"
    new "机密档案。许可等级：III–VI"

    # game/codex.rpy:1227
    old "Document: Report № ABYSS–II/13"
    new "文件：报告 № ABYSS–II/13"

    # game/codex.rpy:1228
    old "Subject: Object «The Abyss»"
    new "主题：对象«深渊»"

    # game/codex.rpy:1229
    old "Status: Official existence unrecognized"
    new "状态：官方不承认其存在"

    # game/codex.rpy:1233
    old "I. General Overview"
    new "一、概述"

    # game/codex.rpy:1235
    old "The object, provisionally designated as «The Abyss», is classified in the public domain as myth, folklore horror, or a component of conspiracy theories.  "
    new "该对象被临时指定为«深渊»，在公共领域被归类为神话、民间恐怖故事或阴谋论的组成部分。  "

    # game/codex.rpy:1237
    old "Among the general population, belief in the existence of The Abyss is entirely absent."
    new "在普通民众中，完全不存在对深渊存在的信仰。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1239
    old "A different situation exists within higher echelons of power. Heads of federations and representatives of the upper strata possess fragmentary knowledge regarding The Abyss and consider it a potential source of unique information."
    new "在权力高层则情况不同。联邦首脑和上层代表掌握关于深渊的零碎知识，并将其视为独特信息的潜在来源。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1241
    old "II. Level of Awareness"
    new "二、认知程度"

    # game/codex.rpy:1243
    old "A widely circulated rumor among elites asserts that The Abyss contains knowledge capable of sustaining continuity of consciousness, erroneously interpreted as immortality."
    new "精英阶层中广泛流传的谣言声称，深渊包含能够维持意识连续性的知识，被错误地解读为永生。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1245
    old "Consequently, numerous attempts have been documented to:"
    new "因此，已记录了大量尝试："

    # game/codex.rpy:1247
    old "identify access pathways;"
    new "确定进入路径；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1248
    old "restore lost navigational data;"
    new "恢复丢失的导航数据；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1249
    old "activate ancient gates of unknown origin."
    new "激活来源不明的古代之门。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1251
    old "Accurate information regarding the true nature of The Abyss is known to an extremely limited number of individuals (see Appendix VI)."
    new "关于深渊真实本质的准确信息仅为极少数人所知（见附录VI）。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1253
    old "III. Spatial Nature of the Object"
    new "三、对象的空间性质"

    # game/codex.rpy:1255
    old "The Abyss represents an isolated fragment of a star system, consisting of 13 planets, each containing remnants of the Ancient Empire's civilization."
    new "深渊是一个恒星系的孤立碎片，由13颗行星组成，每颗行星都包含古代帝国文明的遗迹。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1257
    old "Structurally, the object is analogous to the Solar System, but it exists in a distant future stage of its evolutionary cycle:"
    new "在结构上，该对象类似于太阳系，但处于其演化周期中遥远的未来阶段："

    # game/codex.rpy:1258
    old "the central star is absent;"
    new "中央恒星缺失；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1259
    old "planets lack a light source;;"
    new "行星缺乏光源；；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1260
    old "the system's thermal equilibrium is stable and does not conform to known physical models."
    new "该系统的热平衡稳定，不符合已知的物理模型。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1262
    old "The object is isolated from the galaxy at large, evades standard observation, and disrupts cause-and-effect temporal sequences."
    new "该对象与整个银河隔绝，逃避标准观测，并扰乱因果时间序列。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1264
    old "Effectively, The Abyss is classified as a separate world, localized within a closed sector of the galaxy."
    new "实际上，深渊被归类为一个独立世界，局限于银河的一个封闭区域。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1265
    old "Access is only possible through the use of Ancient Gates (success is not guaranteed)."
    new "只能通过使用古代之门进入（不保证成功）。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1267
    old "IV. Origin"
    new "四、起源"

    # game/codex.rpy:1269
    old "The Abyss is the result of a failed experiment by the Ancient Empire, related to temporal manipulation."
    new "深渊是古代帝国一次与时间操纵相关的失败实验的结果。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1271
    old "According to reconstructed data:"
    new "根据重建的数据："

    # game/codex.rpy:1272
    old "the experiment was sanctioned by the empire's highest authority;"
    new "该实验经帝国最高当局批准；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1273
    old "its objective was to overcome the finiteness of existence;"
    new "其目标是克服存在的有限性；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1274
    old "the experiment utilized the Astreon System to manipulate time;"
    new "该实验利用阿斯特雷昂系统操纵时间；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1275
    old "the outcome was the collapse of the entire civilization."
    new "结果是整个文明的崩溃。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1277
    old "The Ancient Empire ceased to exist entirely.  "
    new "古代帝国完全不复存在。  "

    # game/codex.rpy:1278
    old "No subject survived or exited the experimental zone."
    new "没有任何对象幸存或离开实验区。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1280
    old "The Abyss is classified as a failure caused by greedy ambition and the transgression of permissible limits."
    new "深渊被归类为因贪婪野心和逾越可容许界限而导致的失败。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1282
    old "V. Principle of So-Called «Immortality»"
    new "五、所谓«永生»的原理"

    # game/codex.rpy:1284
    old "The key mechanism, erroneously interpreted as a path to eternal life, is designated as the «Resurrection Point.»"
    new "被错误解读为通往永生之路的关键机制，被指定为«复活点»。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1286
    old "Characteristics:"
    new "特征："

    # game/codex.rpy:1287
    old "upon the death of a subject, physical form is restored;"
    new "对象死亡后，物理形态被恢复；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1288
    old "each subsequent activation shifts the Resurrection Point closer to the moment of final collapse (Death);"
    new "每次后续激活都会将复活点移向最终崩溃（死亡）的时刻；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1289
    old "the process is irreversible."
    new "该过程不可逆。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1291
    old "Therefore:"
    new "因此："

    # game/codex.rpy:1292
    old "immortality is a limited and diminishing resource;"
    new "永生是一种有限且递减的资源；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1293
    old "ultimate death is inevitable;"
    new "最终死亡不可避免；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1294
    old "the mechanism is ineffective for achieving true eternal life."
    new "该机制无法实现真正的永生。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1296
    old "This fact is concealed."
    new "这一事实被隐瞒。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1297
    old "Verified information on the nature of the Resurrection Point is known to no more than a few subjects galaxy-wide."
    new "关于复活点本质的经核实信息，全银河不超过数人知晓。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1299
    old "Each activation of the Resurrection Point consumes energy equivalent to a concentration of Ancient Blood, limiting the number of possible restorations."
    new "复活点的每次激活消耗相当于一份古代之血浓度的能量，限制了可能的恢复次数。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1303
    old "The Abyss is not a repository of knowledge and does not represent an evolutionary advancement."
    new "深渊不是知识的宝库，也不代表进化的进步。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1304
    old "It is the vestige of a catastrophe left behind by a civilization that decided limits could be ignored."
    new "它是一个决定无视界限的文明留下的灾难遗迹。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1306
    old "Dissemination of information regarding the true nature of The Abyss is classified as a threat to systemic stability."
    new "传播关于深渊真实本质的信息被归类为对系统稳定的威胁。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1308
    old "Codex Recommendations:"
    new "法典建议："

    # game/codex.rpy:1309
    old "maintain myth status;"
    new "维持神话地位；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1310
    old "control access to gates;"
    new "控制对门的进入；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1311
    old "eliminate attempts at unauthorized investigation."
    new "消除未经授权调查的尝试。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1322
    old "Closed Archive. Clearance Level: IV–VI"
    new "封闭档案。许可等级：IV–VI"

    # game/codex.rpy:1340
    old "Document: Report № KEEP–ORIGIN/II"
    new "文件：报告 № KEEP–ORIGIN/II"

    # game/codex.rpy:1341
    old "Subject: Class «Keeper» Entities"
    new "主题：«守护者»级实体"

    # game/codex.rpy:1342
    old "Status: Active. Origin Classified"
    new "状态：活跃。起源机密"

    # game/codex.rpy:1349
    old "The Keepers are autonomous high-order entities tasked with overseeing the stability of the galactic system and enforcing the preservation of the so-called Balance."
    new "守护者是自主的高阶实体，负责监督银河系统的稳定并强制维持所谓的平衡。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1351
    old "Their activity is not directed toward the protection of individual states,species, or civilizations, but toward maintaining the long-term structural integrity of the galaxy as a whole."
    new "他们的活动不针对保护个别国家、物种或文明，而是维护整个银河的长期结构完整性。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1353
    old "II. Nature and Limitations"
    new "二、本质与局限"

    # game/codex.rpy:1355
    old "The Keepers possess significant resources and power, granting them substantial influence over galaxy-level political processes."
    new "守护者拥有大量资源和权力，赋予他们对银河级政治进程的实质性影响力。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1357
    old "However:"
    new "然而："

    # game/codex.rpy:1358
    old "the Keepers are not an absolute force;"
    new "守护者并非绝对力量；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1359
    old "they are mortal;"
    new "他们终有一死；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1360
    old "their physical destruction is possible, though it requires expenditures deemed strategically unjustified."
    new "他们的物理消灭是可能的，尽管需要被认为战略上不合理的代价。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1362
    old "The presence of vulnerability is documented and considered acceptable within the framework of Balance preservation."
    new "脆弱性的存在已被记录，并在维护平衡的框架内被视为可接受。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1364
    old "III. Principles of Intervention"
    new "三、干预原则"

    # game/codex.rpy:1366
    old "Intervention by the Keepers is strictly limited in nature."
    new "守护者的干预本质上是严格受限的。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1368
    old "They:"
    new "他们："

    # game/codex.rpy:1369
    old "do not participate in local conflicts;"
    new "不参与局部冲突；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1370
    old "do not prevent wars or mass casualties;"
    new "不阻止战争或大规模伤亡；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1371
    old "do not interfere in confrontations that possess internal, self-sustaining causes."
    new "不干涉具有内部自我维持原因的对抗。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1373
    old "The criterion for intervention is not the scale of violence, but the degree of threat posed to the integrity of the Balance."
    new "干预的标准不是暴力的规模，而是对平衡完整性构成的威胁程度。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1378
    old "IV. Origin (Restricted Classification)"
    new "四、起源（受限分类）"

    # game/codex.rpy:1380
    old "The Keepers are former members of the fallen Ancient Empire."
    new "守护者是覆灭的古代帝国的前成员。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1382
    old "This fact is:"
    new "这一事实："

    # game/codex.rpy:1383
    old "not officially confirmed;"
    new "未经官方确认；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1384
    old "prohibited from dissemination;"
    new "禁止传播；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1385
    old "recorded within the closed Codex archives as critically significant."
    new "作为极其重要的信息记录在封闭的法典档案中。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1387
    old "Their continued existence is regarded as a consequence of the catastrophe that led to the disappearanceof the Ancient Empire."
    new "他们的持续存在被视为导致古代帝国消失的灾难的后果。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1393
    old "Opens at the end of the fifth act."
    new "在第五幕结尾开放。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1404
    old "V. Stance Toward the Ancient Legacy"
    new "五、对古代遗产的立场"

    # game/codex.rpy:1406
    old "Any activity associated with:"
    new "任何与以下相关的活动："

    # game/codex.rpy:1407
    old "research into the Ancient Empire;"
    new "对古代帝国的研究；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1408
    old "restoration of its technologies;"
    new "其技术的恢复；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1409
    old "reference to or study of its legacy, is suppressed by the Keepers immediately and without deliberation."
    new "对其遗产的提及或研究，都会被守护者立即无条件压制。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1411
    old "This protocol requires no justification and is executed automatically."
    new "此协议无需理由，自动执行。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1413
    old "VI. Interaction with Federations"
    new "六、与联邦的互动"

    # game/codex.rpy:1415
    old "The Keepers exercise heightened caution toward:"
    new "守护者对以下对象保持高度警惕："

    # game/codex.rpy:1416
    old "heads of federations;"
    new "联邦首脑；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1417
    old "major political conglomerates;"
    new "主要政治集团；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1418
    old "federations as systemic nodes of the Balance."
    new "作为平衡系统节点的联邦。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1420
    old "The destruction of an entire federation is classified as an event with excessive consequences capable of destabilizing galactic equilibrium."
    new "摧毁整个联邦被归类为具有过度后果、可能破坏银河平衡的事件。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1422
    old "In isolated cases, the Keepers permit:"
    new "在个别情况下，守护者允许："

    # game/codex.rpy:1423
    old "individual breaches of prohibitions;"
    new "个别违反禁令的行为；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1424
    old "personal research of Ancient Empire ruins by heads of federations;"
    new "联邦首脑对古代帝国遗迹的个人研究；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1425
    old "provided that such actions do not exceed the acceptable risk threshold."
    new "前提是此类行为不超过可接受的风险阈值。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1427
    old "VII. Threshold of Acceptability"
    new "七、可接受性阈值"

    # game/codex.rpy:1429
    old "A critical boundary exists, beyond which:"
    new "存在一条临界边界，越过之后："

    # game/codex.rpy:1430
    old "preservation of a federation becomes less significant than restoration of Balance;"
    new "维护联邦的重要性低于恢复平衡；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1431
    old "its destruction is deemed justified."
    new "其毁灭被视为正当。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1433
    old "The exact formulation of this threshold is unknown."
    new "该阈值的确切表述未知。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1434
    old "No warning is issued prior to intervention."
    new "干预前不发出警告。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1439
    old "VIII. Conclusion"
    new "八、结论"

    # game/codex.rpy:1441
    old "The Keepers are not judges, saviors, nor rulers of the galaxy."
    new "守护者不是银河的法官、救世主或统治者。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1443
    old "They are remnants of a civilization that outlived its own end, acting as regulators seeking to prevent the recurrence of catastrophe."
    new "他们是一个比自身终结活得更久的文明的残余，作为试图防止灾难重演的调节者。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1445
    old "Balance, to the Keepers, is not an ideal."
    new "对守护者而言，平衡不是理想。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1446
    old "It is a form of atonement."
    new "它是一种赎罪。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1469
    old "Closed Archive. Clearance Level: V–VI"
    new "封闭档案。许可等级：V–VI"

    # game/codex.rpy:1487
    old "Document: Report № GATE–AST/14"
    new "文件：报告 № GATE–AST/14"

    # game/codex.rpy:1488
    old "Subject: Object «Ancient Gates»"
    new "主题：对象«古代之门»"

    # game/codex.rpy:1489
    old "Status: Prohibited from Operation"
    new "状态：禁止运作"

    # game/codex.rpy:1494
    old "I. Purpose and Origin"
    new "一、目的与起源"

    # game/codex.rpy:1496
    old "The Ancient Gates are entry mechanisms to the Astreon System, designed for instantaneous transfer of matter, military units, and resources across intergalactic distances."
    new "古代之门是进入阿斯特雷昂系统的入口机制，设计用于在星际距离上瞬时传送物质、军事单位和资源。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1498
    old "The technology was developed by the Ancient Empire for the purposes of:"
    new "该技术由古代帝国开发，用于："

    # game/codex.rpy:1499
    old "strategic deployment of armed forces;"
    new "武装力量的战略部署；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1500
    old "transport of mineral and industrial resources from remote regions of the galaxy."
    new "从银河遥远区域运输矿产和工业资源。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1502
    old "Due to the extreme complexity of construction and exceptional energy requirements, the use of the Gates has been strictly limited since their creation."
    new "由于建造极其复杂和异常的能量需求，自创建以来，门的使用一直受到严格限制。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1504
    old "II. Portal Network Structure"
    new "二、传送门网络结构"

    # game/codex.rpy:1506
    old "Within the galaxy, fourteen primary portals have been recorded, interconnected into a single closed network."
    new "银河内已记录十四个主传送门，互联成一个封闭网络。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1507
    old "These primary portals served as the basis for secondary, lower-capacity connectors."
    new "这些主传送门是次级低容量连接器的基础。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1509
    old "Each federation possesses at least one primary portal within its jurisdiction."
    new "每个联邦在其管辖范围内至少拥有一个主传送门。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1511
    old "Certain federations maintain multiple objects of this type."
    new "某些联邦维持多个此类对象。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1513
    old "III. Legal Status"
    new "三、法律地位"

    # game/codex.rpy:1515
    old "Despite their strategic value, the operation of the Ancient Gates is categorically prohibited by:"
    new "尽管具有战略价值，古代之门的运作被以下机构明确禁止："

    # game/codex.rpy:1516
    old "resolution of the Galactic Council;"
    new "银河议会决议；"

    # game/codex.rpy:1517
    old "direct decree of the Keepers."
    new "守护者的直接法令。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1519
    old "Threat Classification: galactic scale."
    new "威胁分类：银河级。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1521
    old "Any attempt at activation is considered a crime against the stability of the entire galactic system."
    new "任何激活尝试都被视为危害整个银河系统稳定的罪行。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1523
    old "IV. Energy Principle"
    new "四、能量原理"

    # game/codex.rpy:1525
    old "The Gates are powered by a substance provisionally designated as the “Blood of the Ancients.”"
    new "门由一种临时指定为“古代之血”的物质驱动。"

    # game/codex.rpy:1528
